{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "issue": 709,
  "purpose": "Which change touches which measurement axis (docs/specs/execution-plan.md). Rules are tried in order; the first matching rule gives a file its change kind. A file no rule matches is `unclassified`: the plan refuses to guess and asks for a decision instead of measuring.",
